(5, '3', 'Pinewood-Pallet', 'Pinewood Pallet', '6787a69b95670_Frame 126 (1).webp,6787a69b95677_Frame 125 (1).webp,6787a69b95678_Frame 124 (1).webp,6787a69b95679_Frame 117 (2).webp,6787a69b9567a_Frame 127.webp', 'Pinewood Pallet', 'Buy premium Pinewood Pallets from SKN Industries for strong, durable, and reliable material handling. Ideal for shipping & storage. Order high-quality pallets today!', 'High-Quality Pinewood Pallet | Durable & Sturdy Pallets – SKN Industries', 'product-details-pinewood-pallet', '2026-Jun-11', '<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Product Description</h4>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Having a clear-cut quality management system, we are regarded as the noteworthy manufacturer and supplier of an extensive gamut of Pine Wood Pallets. These pallets are used for loading purposes. Offered pallets are designed to suit the intended function and are highly effective in warehousing and logistics. Offered pallets are manufactured using premium grade wood under the supervision of adroit professionals. Moreover, we are providing these Pine Wood Pallets at market leading prices to our esteemed customers.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Specification</h4>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Material : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Wood</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Wood Type : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Pinewood</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Location Preference : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Local Area</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Usage : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Packaging</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Shape : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Rectangular</span></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Major Key Features:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Facilitate easy stacking</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">High strength</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Low Maintenance</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">High durability</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Recyclable</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Long lasting</li>\r\n</ul>', '/pinewood-pallet');
