(6, '3', 'Eucalyptus-Pallet', 'Eucalyptus Pallet', '6787a6e85e023_Frame 127 (1).webp,6787a6e85e02c_Frame 126 (2).webp', 'Eucalyptus Pallet, Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer', 'Looking for a trusted Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer? SKN Industries offers strong, durable & eco-friendly wooden pallets for storage, logistics & export use. ', 'Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer | Durable Wooden Pallets', 'product-details-eucalyptus-pallet', '2026-Jun-29', '<h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Product Description</h2>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">In our endeavors to be one of the well-known names in this domain, we have equipped ourselves with leading technology for the production of Eucalyptus Pallet. This pallet is designed and manufactured at state-of-the-art infrastructural facilities using the best quality wood and the pioneering technology. It is used to provide protection to various materials during transportation. Further, we offer this Eucalyptus Pallet at the most affordable price to our esteemed clients.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Major Key Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Facilitate easy stacking</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">High strength</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Low Maintenance</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">High durability</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Recyclable</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Long lasting</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Easy to handle</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sturdiness</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Termite resistance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer for Strong Pallets</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The need to have robust and trustworthy pallets is on the rise in the current industrial and export packaging industry, which is growing at a very high rate. Eucalyptus wood is a great option in case you are seeking a reliable Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer. Eucalyptus wood is known to be very strong, durable, and cost-effective and is therefore used extensively in the production of pallets.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A professional Eucalyptus Pallet offers pallets that are capable of carrying heavy loads and at the same time perform over a long period. These pallets are common in the logistics, warehousing, and export sectors and thus are a favorite among firms that would want reliable packaging products.</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">What is a Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A Eucalyptus <a href=\"../blog-detail-Plywood-Pallets-Manufacturers-for-Strong-Logistics-Use\">Pallet Manufacturer</a> is an enterprise that designs and manufactures wooden pallets with the use of the best quality of wood, eucalyptus. These pallets are primarily utilized in the storage, handling and transportation of goods effectively.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Eucalyptus wood is a hardwood that is fast growing and exhibits high strength and resistance; hence it is the best creation of pallets. A good Eucalyptus Pallet is one which ensures that every pallet is produced in line with the industry standard and as per the business demand.</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Benefits of Choosing Eucalyptus Pallets</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The benefits of using pallets manufactured by a professional Eucalyptus <a href=\"../blog-detail-Plywood-Pallets-Manufacturers-Delivering-Durable-Pallets\">Pallet</a> Manufacturer are:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">High load-bearing capacity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Long-lasting durability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Termite resistance and moisture resistance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Economical bulk solution.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Sustainable and eco-friendly material.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The above advantages render eucalyptus pallets an intelligent investment to use in industries and business.</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Why Choose a Professional Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">It is necessary to choose a professional Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer to provide an equal level of performance and quality. A reliable manufacturer supplies:</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Durable and standardized pallets.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Tailor-made prices and designs.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">ISPM-15 compliant pallets (export-ready).</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Bulk production capabilities</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">On time delivery and support.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Collaboration with a seasoned Eucalyptus <a href=\"../blog-detail-Best-Quality-Plywood-Pallets-for-Shipping\">Pallet</a> facilitates the process of supply chain operations.</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Applications of Eucalyptus Wooden Pallets</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Pallets produced by a reliable Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer are widely used in multiple industries:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Logistics and transportation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Warehousing and storage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">FMCG sector</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Pharmaceutical industry</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Export and shipping firms.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">They are strong and durable and therefore can be used in heavy-duty operations.</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Types of Eucalyptus Pallets</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">There are many types of pallets that can be provided by a professional &nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eucalyptus\">Eucalyptus</a> Pallet &nbsp;to satisfy various requirements:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Two-way entry pallets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Four-way entry pallets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Euro pallets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Block pallets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Customized wooden pallets</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">These alternatives offer versatility in relation to the varied industries and operation needs.</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Eucalyptus vs Pine vs Plastic Pallets</h2>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" align=\"left\">\r\n<table><colgroup><col width=\"99\"><col width=\"97\"><col width=\"76\"><col width=\"82\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Feature</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Eucalyptus</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Pine</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Plastic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Strength</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">High</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Medium</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">High</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Cost</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Affordable</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Low</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Expensive</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Durability</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Long-lasting</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Moderate</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Very long</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Eco-Friendly</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Yes</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Yes</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">No</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Pallets supplied by a reputable Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer have the best strength and cost balance when compared to other materials.</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Why SKN Industries</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"../\">SKN industries</a> is one name that is trusted in the business and has earned a reputation of providing quality wooden pallets. The company is a reputable Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer and it is specialized in offering quality and affordable pallet solutions to various business requirements.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Their dedication to quality and customer satisfaction makes them a better choice among many industries.</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Quality Standards &amp; Manufacturing Process</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">A professional <a href=\"../blogs\">Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer</a> adheres to a systematic production process to be of high quality:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Premium eucalyptus wood is selected.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Accuracy in cutting and shaping.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Heat treatment according to the ISPM-15 requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assembly and finishing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Final quality inspection</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">This process will assure that all pallets will be of industrial standards and will provide performance over a long period.</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">How to Choose the Best Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">In choosing the appropriate Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer, the following factors should be put into consideration:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience and reputation in the industry.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Quality of products and certifications.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Customization options</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Competitive pricing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Delivery timelines</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The selection of the appropriate manufacturer guarantees increased efficiency and reliability of your operations.</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">FAQs</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Q1. What is the durability of eucalyptus pallets?</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer provides pallets that are very hardy and can carry a lot of weight.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Q2. Are eucalyptus pallets exportable?</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Yes, pallets with heat treatment are exportable globally.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Q3. Does the manufacturer offer tailor pallet sizes?</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Yes, the majority of manufacturers provide customized pallet solutions.<strong><br></strong></p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">Conclusion</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">In the contemporary competitive market it is important to select the appropriate pallet solution in order to have an effective logistics and storage. A reputable Eucalyptus Pallet Manufacturer will supply strong, durable and cost-effective pallets that satisfy the current industrial requirement.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Collaborating with a reputable manufacturer of Eucalyptus Pallets, companies will be able to enhance their supply chain effectiveness and guarantee sustainable performance.</p>', '/eucalyptus-pallet'),
(7, '4', 'Customised-CFB-Box', 'Customised CFB Box', '6787a744e06fc_Frame 126 (4).webp', 'Customised CFB Boxes ', 'Get high-quality customised CFB boxes from SKN Industries for secure and personalized packaging solutions. Ideal for various industries. Explore our custom packaging today!', 'Customised CFB Boxes – Durable & Tailor-Made Packaging | SKN Industries', 'product-details-customised-cfb-box', '2026-Jun-11', '<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Product Description</h4>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">We have a dedicated team for onsite packaging development. We analyze the requirement of customer working conditions dispatch destinations and then submit the samples and after getting approvals we supply total material on daily supply basis . We keep the inventory as per the dispatch schedule of our customers and pack the material on the customer site in our supervision.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Specification</h4>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Material : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Corrugated</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Shape : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Rectangular</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Pattern : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Plain</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Thickness : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">4-6 mm</span></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Key Features:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Long lasting</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Easy handling</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">durable</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Light Weight</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Recyclable</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Easy mobility</li>\r\n</ul>', '/customised-cfb-box'),
(8, '4', 'Plywood-Boxes', 'Plywood Boxes', '6787a796b6c06_Frame 125 (2).webp,6787a796b6c0f_Frame 124 (2).webp,6787a796b6c10_Frame 117 (4).webp', 'Plywood Boxes', 'Get premium Plywood Boxes from SKN Industries, designed for durability, strength, and secure packaging. Ideal for shipping & storage. Order high-quality boxes today!', 'High-Quality Plywood Boxes | Durable Packaging Solutions – SKN Industries', 'product-details-plywood-boxes', '2026-Jun-11', '<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Product Description</h4>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">We bring forth for our clients a broad assortment of high quality Plywood Boxes. The offered boxes are primarily used for the purpose of packaging a wide variety of materials and products. These boxes provide a complete protection to the packaged materials, thus eliminate the possibility of damage during transit. We believe in delivering total client satisfaction through our customized Plywood Boxes that are offered at industry leading rates to our valuable patrons.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Specification</h4>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Material : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Wood</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Wood Type : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Solid Wood</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Material Thickness : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5-15mm</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Usage : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Pharmaceutical,Household,Shipping,Food</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Shape : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Rectangular</span></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Key Features:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Resistivity to termite attacks</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Excellent strength</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Long lasting</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Easy handling</li>\r\n</ul>', '/plywood-boxes'),
(9, '4', 'Pinewood-Box', 'Pinewood Box', '6787a7e1158f9_Pinewood-Box.webp', ' Pinewood Box', 'Get premium Pinewood Boxes from SKN Industries, designed for strength, durability, and secure packaging. Ideal for storage & shipping. Order high-quality boxes today!', 'High-Quality Pinewood Box | Durable & Reliable Packaging – SKN Industries', 'product-details-pinewood-box', '2026-Jun-11', '<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Product Description</h4>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">We come under the category of foremost manufacturers and suppliers of superior quality Pinewood Box. It is mainly used in logistics and warehousing of various products and materials. Manufactured from the best quality pine wood, this box finds wide application in automobile industry, building and constructions as well as agricultural industry. The process of manufacturing of this box is supervised by a team of highly experienced professionals who ensure that only superior quality boxes are manufactured. Moreover, our clients can easily avail this Pinewood Box from us at the most reasonable prices.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Key Features:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Resistivity to termite attacks</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Excellent strength</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Long lasting</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Easy handling</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Impact resistance</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Highly durable</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sturdiness</li>\r\n</ul>', '/pinewood-box'),
(10, '4', 'Eucalyptus-Storage-Boxes', 'Eucalyptus Storage Boxes', '6787a87c6c5d3_Eucalyptus-Storage-Boxes.webp', 'Eucalyptus Storage Boxes', 'Get premium Eucalyptus Storage Boxes from SKN Industries, designed for durability, eco-friendliness, and secure packaging. Perfect for shipping & storage. Order now!', 'Durable Eucalyptus Storage Boxes | High-Quality Packaging – SKN Industries', 'product-details-eucalyptus-storage-boxes', '2026-Jun-11', '<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Product Description</h4>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">With years of expertise, we are engaged in manufacturing and supplying a wide array of Eucalyptus Storage Boxes. These boxes are widely used for storing, packaging, transporting and handling a wide range of products. We manufacture these boxes using the best quality eucalyptus wood under the guidance of our deft professionals in compliance with the set norms of quality. Further, the offered range of Eucalyptus Storage Boxes can be customized as per the requirements of our clients at industry leading rates.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Specification</h4>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Material : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Wood</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; box-sizing: border-box; color: #212529; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system,;\">Shape : <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Rectangular</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"-webkit-text